The same DashboardService schema includes x, whose request takes x and an int32 x, and whose response contains named x items.
Exact-symbol searches find no caller or field consumer in the full packaged Cursor 3.18.9 workbench or agent-host JavaScript, so the source does not establish the timestamp unit, item meanings, settlement timing, or concurrent-request behavior.

