# swift-ngtcp2 AGENTS.md
x reads no files.
SwiftPM reads a dependency's manifest from git without its submodules, so a manifest that lists x builds here and fails for every consumer (0.0.1 did).
Its source lists are literals that x writes from the submodules; x (part of x) fails when they differ.

# swift-ngtcp2 AGENTS.md
Move a submodule only to an upstream release tag, never to a branch head, then run x and x.
The x workflow does this every week and opens a pull request.

# swift-ngtcp2 README.md
Each release of this package pins one release of ngtcp2 and nghttp3, and takes swift-nio-ssl from the version listed up to its next major version.
